{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_cc88c50d65c844128c0d23b0","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Ralph Progress Log\n     2→\n     3→This file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\n     4→after each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n     5→\n     6→## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n     7→\n     8→*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n     9→\n    10→---\n    11→\n    12→## 2024-02-08 - US-048\n    13→- Created complete website for Dra. Angélica Lucena - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    14→- Files changed:\n    15→  - `site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena/index.html` (new)\n    16→- **Design Concept**: Ethereal/Luminous aesthetic with rose, gold, and champagne color palette. Organic blob shapes with floating animations create a dreamy, transformative atmosphere perfect for facial harmonization specialist.\n    17→- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Montserrat (body) for elegant, premium feel\n    18→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    19→  - Animated hero with 3 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    20→  - Parallax mouse movement effect on blobs\n    21→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    22→  - Problem/Solution section with visual cards\n    23→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    24→  - 3 testimonial cards with star ratings\n    25→  - 6 differential items with icons\n    26→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    27→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    28→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    29→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    30→- **Contact Info**: R. Garibaldi, 1928 - Jardim Sumaré, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14025-382 | (16) 99635-3208\n    31→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena\n    32→- **Verification**:\n    33→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n    34→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n    35→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n    36→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n    37→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    38→\n    39→**Learnings:**\n    40→- **Pattern**: Ethereal aesthetic works exceptionally well for facial harmonization/esthetic clinics - the soft gradients and luminous effects reinforce the \"glow\" and \"transformation\" aspects of the treatments\n    41→- **Pattern**: Using CSS variables for organic border-radius (`--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%`) creates unique blob shapes that animate beautifully\n    42→- **Pattern**: WhatsApp form integration is highly effective - converts form submissions directly into conversations\n    43→- **Gotcha**: Image URL from Unsplash (woman's face) appropriate for facial harmonization specialist\n    44→- **Gotcha**: The rose-gold-champagne palette (Ethereal Rose & Gold) creates a luxurious feminine aesthetic that appeals to the target demographic\n    45→- **Gotcha**: Cormorant Garamond as display font adds sophistication and elegance without being overly formal\n    46→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n    47→- **Mobile optimization**: Single-column layouts for grid components on mobile, stacked hero with image below content\n    48→\n    49→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n    50→- **Ethereal Rose & Gold Palette**: `--color-blush: #F8E8E8`, `--color-rose: #E8B4B8`, `--color-gold: #C9A86C`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - perfect for aesthetic/esthetic clinics\n    51→- **Organic Blob Animation**: Multi-layer animated blobs with blur filters create depth and movement without being distracting\n    52→- **WhatsApp Form Handler**: JavaScript that formats form data into WhatsApp message and opens API URL directly\n    53→\n    54→---\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b2b5fe1-65ed-4b78-ae03-7f6126461dbf","uuid":"dceced9e-31c5-46e1-a00d-458683169fb7","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/.ralph-tui/progress.md","content":"# Ralph Progress Log\n\nThis file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\nafter each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n\n## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n\n*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n\n---\n\n## 2024-02-08 - US-048\n- Created complete website for Dra. Angélica Lucena - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n- Files changed:\n  - `site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena/index.html` (new)\n- **Design Concept**: Ethereal/Luminous aesthetic with rose, gold, and champagne color palette. Organic blob shapes with floating animations create a dreamy, transformative atmosphere perfect for facial harmonization specialist.\n- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Montserrat (body) for elegant, premium feel\n- **Key Features Implemented**:\n  - Animated hero with 3 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n  - Parallax mouse movement effect on blobs\n  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n  - Problem/Solution section with visual cards\n  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n  - 3 testimonial cards with star ratings\n  - 6 differential items with icons\n  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n- **Contact Info**: R. Garibaldi, 1928 - Jardim Sumaré, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14025-382 | (16) 99635-3208\n- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena\n- **Verification**:\n  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n\n**Learnings:**\n- **Pattern**: Ethereal aesthetic works exceptionally well for facial harmonization/esthetic clinics - the soft gradients and luminous effects reinforce the \"glow\" and \"transformation\" aspects of the treatments\n- **Pattern**: Using CSS variables for organic border-radius (`--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%`) creates unique blob shapes that animate beautifully\n- **Pattern**: WhatsApp form integration is highly effective - converts form submissions directly into conversations\n- **Gotcha**: Image URL from Unsplash (woman's face) appropriate for facial harmonization specialist\n- **Gotcha**: The rose-gold-champagne palette (Ethereal Rose & Gold) creates a luxurious feminine aesthetic that appeals to the target demographic\n- **Gotcha**: Cormorant Garamond as display font adds sophistication and elegance without being overly formal\n- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n- **Mobile optimization**: Single-column layouts for grid components on mobile, stacked hero with image below content\n\n**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n- **Ethereal Rose & Gold Palette**: `--color-blush: #F8E8E8`, `--color-rose: #E8B4B8`, `--color-gold: #C9A86C`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - perfect for aesthetic/esthetic clinics\n- **Organic Blob Animation**: Multi-layer animated blobs with blur filters create depth and movement without being distracting\n- **WhatsApp Form Handler**: JavaScript that formats form data into WhatsApp message and opens API URL directly\n\n---","numLines":54,"startLine":1,"totalLines":54}}}
